(a) It shall be a violation of this chapter if any alarm system owner, customer of an alarm system company, or an alarm system company:
(1) Fails to register if required to do so by this chapter;
(2) Fails to pay all applicable registration fees when due;
(3) Fails to update any information as required by this chapter;
